{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15472","headline":"赠岐山姜明府 · 李端","name":"赠岐山姜明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜闻山雨，归心便似迟。\n几回惊叶落，即到白头时。\n雁影将魂去，虫声与泪期。\n马卿兼病老，宋玉对秋悲。\n谢客才爲别，陶公已见思。\n非关口腹累，自是雪霜姿。\n酿酒栽黄菊，炊粳折绿葵。\n山河方入望，风日正宜诗。\n牧竖寒骑马，边烽晚立旗。\n兰凋犹有气，柳脆不成丝。\n别後如相问，高僧知所之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}